cat > "${WEBROOT}/assets/stillform/style.css" <<'EOF_ASSETS_STILLFORM_STYLE_CSS'
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
[hidden] { display: none !important; }
body {
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--canvas);
  color: var(--text);
  font: 1rem/1.55 var(--font), system-ui, sans-serif;
}
main { flex: 1; padding-bottom: 80px; }
h1, h2, p, figure { margin: 0; }
h1, h2 { text-wrap: balance; line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -.055em; }
p { text-wrap: pretty; }
a { color: inherit; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
a:hover { text-decoration-thickness: 2px; }
:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--focus); outline-offset: 4px; }
img { display: block; max-width: 100%; }
.wrap { width: min(100% - 96px, 1320px); margin-inline: auto; }
.skip { position: absolute; z-index: 1; padding: 8px 12px; background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-text); top: 0; clip-path: inset(50%); }
.skip:focus { clip-path: none; }
.masthead, .footer, .section-title { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; }
.masthead { min-height: 80px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
.brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
nav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; }
nav a { color: var(--muted); font-size: .875rem; text-decoration: none; }
nav a:hover, nav a[aria-current="page"] { color: var(--text); text-decoration: underline; }
.hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 3fr); align-items: center; gap: 48px; margin-top: 48px; }
h1 { font-weight: 700; font-size: 4.5rem; }
.hero h1 { margin: 16px 0 24px; font-size: 6rem; }
.lede { max-width: 48ch; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.125rem; }
.button {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  min-height: 44px;
  padding: 8px 16px;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  background: var(--accent);
  color: var(--accent-text);
  font-weight: 700;
  text-decoration: none;
}
.button:hover { border-color: currentColor; text-decoration: underline; }
.button:active { transform: translateY(1px); }
.hero .button { margin-top: 32px; }
.hero img { width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 3/2; object-fit: cover; background: var(--surface); }
figcaption, .eyebrow, .count { font-size: .875rem; color: var(--muted); }
.eyebrow { font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .09em; text-transform: uppercase; }
figcaption { margin-top: 12px; }
.section { margin-top: 64px; }
.section-title { margin-bottom: 24px; }
.section-title h2, .statement h2 { font-size: 2.25rem; }
.section-title a { flex-shrink: 0; font-size: .875rem; }
.statement { background: var(--surface); padding: 40px; }
.statement h2 { margin: 16px 0 24px; line-height: 1.12; }
.section-head { max-width: 680px; margin: 64px 0 40px; }
.section-head h1 { margin: 16px 0; }
.filters { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.filters button {
  min-height: 44px;
  padding: 8px 16px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--text);
  font: inherit;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.filters button[aria-pressed="true"] { background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-text); border-color: var(--accent); }
.filters button:hover { border-color: var(--focus); }
.count:not(:empty) { margin-bottom: 16px; }
.entries article > p:last-child, details p { color: var(--muted); }
.details { max-width: 760px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
details { padding-block: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
summary { width: fit-content; font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
details p { margin-top: 12px; }
.footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-block: 24px; }
@media (max-width: 1050px) {
  .hero h1 { font-size: 4.5rem; }
}
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .wrap { width: calc(100% - 48px); }
  .hero { gap: 24px; }
}
@media (max-width: 690px) {
  .wrap { width: calc(100% - 32px); }
  .masthead { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; padding-block: 16px; }
  nav { gap: 16px; }
  .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; margin-top: 32px; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: 3.75rem; }
  h1 { font-size: 3rem; }
  .section, .section-head { margin-top: 48px; }
  .section-title { align-items: baseline; }
  .section-title h2 { font-size: 1.875rem; }
  .statement { padding: 24px; }
  .footer { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
}
@font-face { font-family: Manrope; src: url("manrope.woff2") format("woff2"); font-weight: 400 800; font-display: swap; }
:root {
  color-scheme: light;
  --font: Manrope;
  --canvas: #f4f2eb;
  --surface: #ebe5d6;
  --text: #24241d;
  --muted: #5a584d;
  --line: #b3aa94;
  --accent: #292b22;
  --accent-text: #fff9e9;
  --focus: #825a12;
}
.entries { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
.entries article { border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 24px; }
.entries h2 { margin: 24px 0 12px; font-size: 1.875rem; }
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .entries { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
}
@media (max-width: 690px) {
  .entries { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

.media-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
.media-card { min-width: 0; }
.media-card picture, .story-figure picture { display: block; }
.media-card img, .story-figure img { width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 3 / 2; object-fit: cover; background: var(--surface); }
.media-card a { display: block; text-decoration: none; }
.media-card a:hover h3 { text-decoration: underline; }
.media-card h3 { margin: 8px 0; font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
.media-card p:last-child { color: var(--muted); }
.story-toc { margin-top: 24px; }
.story-toc a, .original { font-size: .875rem; }
.media-story { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 3fr) minmax(0, 2fr); align-items: start; gap: 40px; margin-top: 64px; padding-top: 32px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); scroll-margin-top: 24px; }
.media-story h2 { margin: 8px 0 16px; font-size: 2.25rem; }
.story-figure .original { display: inline-block; margin-top: 8px; }
.media-story dl { margin: 24px 0 0; }
.media-story dt { font-weight: 700; }
.media-story dd { margin: 4px 0 16px; color: var(--muted); }
@media (max-width: 900px) { .media-story { gap: 32px; } }
@media (max-width: 690px) {
  .media-grid, .media-story { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
  .media-story { margin-top: 48px; }
  .media-story h2 { font-size: 1.875rem; }
}
.media-card { padding-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
.media-card .media-copy { padding-top: 12px; }
EOF_ASSETS_STILLFORM_STYLE_CSS
cat > "${WEBROOT}/field-notes.html" <<'EOF_FIELD_NOTES_HTML'
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Three lighting studies, with the decisions behind each scene and the checks that matter once the fixtures are in place.">
  <meta property="og:title" content="What the light does">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Three lighting studies, with the decisions behind each scene and the checks that matter once the fixtures are in place.">
  <title>Field notes · Stillform Studio</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/assets/stillform/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/stillform/style.css?v=645902d574">
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
  <header class="wrap masthead">
    <a class="brand" href="/index.html"><img src="/assets/stillform/favicon.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32">Stillform Studio</a>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/index.html">Studio</a><a href="/projects.html">Projects</a><a href="/approach.html">Approach</a><a href="/field-notes.html" aria-current="page">Field notes</a></nav>
  </header>
  <main id="main" class="wrap">
    <header class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">LIGHTING STUDIES</p>
      <h1>What the light does</h1>
      <p class="lede">Three lighting studies, with the decisions behind each scene and the checks that matter once the fixtures are in place.</p>
      <nav class="story-toc" aria-label="On this page"><a href="#reading">The reading room</a><a href="#dining">The long table</a><a href="#courtyard">The quiet courtyard</a></nav>
    </header>
    <article class="media-story" id="reading">
      <figure class="story-figure">
          <picture>
            <source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/stillform/media/reading-480.webp 480w, /assets/stillform/media/reading-800.webp 800w, /assets/stillform/media/reading-1280.webp 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 690px) calc(100vw - 32px), (max-width: 900px) calc((100vw - 80px) * .6), (max-width: 1416px) calc((100vw - 136px) * .6), 768px">
            <img src="/assets/stillform/media/reading-800.jpg" width="800" height="533" alt="Oak reading tables and slim brass lamps beneath tall arched library windows" fetchpriority="high">
          </picture>
        <figcaption>Study of daylight and low task lighting in a public reading room.</figcaption>
        <a class="original" href="/assets/stillform/media/reading-original.jpg" download aria-label="Download the reading room, full resolution JPEG, 876 KB">Full resolution JPEG · 876 KB</a>
      </figure>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Civic interiors</p>
        <h2>The reading room</h2>
        <p>Balance the task light across shared tables as daylight falls away.</p>
        <dl>
          <dt>Separate the rows</dt>
          <dd>Zone tables by distance from the windows. Preserve the brighter window edge during daylight and bring up the inner rows first.</dd>
          <dt>Check both sides</dt>
          <dd>Sit on both sides of the table with a matte page and a glossy screen. Record the view towards the fixture and the reflections you see at reading height.</dd>
          <dt>Describe the scene</dt>
          <dd>Specify which layer supplies light to the table, which keeps the room legible, and how the two change together after dusk.</dd>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="media-story" id="dining">
      <figure class="story-figure">
          <picture>
            <source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/stillform/media/dining-480.webp 480w, /assets/stillform/media/dining-800.webp 800w, /assets/stillform/media/dining-1280.webp 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 690px) calc(100vw - 32px), (max-width: 900px) calc((100vw - 80px) * .6), (max-width: 1416px) calc((100vw - 136px) * .6), 768px">
            <img src="/assets/stillform/media/dining-800.jpg" width="800" height="533" alt="Low opal pendants and warm place settings along a walnut restaurant table" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          </picture>
        <figcaption>Study of layered light for a communal dining room at dusk.</figcaption>
        <a class="original" href="/assets/stillform/media/dining-original.jpg" download aria-label="Download the long table, full resolution JPEG, 725 KB">Full resolution JPEG · 725 KB</a>
      </figure>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Hospitality</p>
        <h2>The long table</h2>
        <p>Use pendants, a soft wall wash and a separate service scene.</p>
        <dl>
          <dt>Set the height</dt>
          <dd>Start with a mockup of one place setting and a pendant at its intended height. Check the sightline across the table and across the room.</dd>
          <dt>Keep routes legible</dt>
          <dd>Light the route to the door separately from the tables so a dimmed dinner scene still leaves steps and corners visible.</dd>
          <dt>Test the changeover</dt>
          <dd>Save separate scenes for service, dinner and cleaning. Have the people who open and close the room try the controls.</dd>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="media-story" id="courtyard">
      <figure class="story-figure">
          <picture>
            <source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/stillform/media/courtyard-480.webp 480w, /assets/stillform/media/courtyard-800.webp 800w, /assets/stillform/media/courtyard-1280.webp 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 690px) calc(100vw - 32px), (max-width: 900px) calc((100vw - 80px) * .6), (max-width: 1416px) calc((100vw - 136px) * .6), 768px">
            <img src="/assets/stillform/media/courtyard-800.jpg" width="800" height="533" alt="Concealed low lights edge a wet stone path through planted courtyard beds" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          </picture>
        <figcaption>A courtyard lighting study at blue hour with a damp stone path.</figcaption>
        <a class="original" href="/assets/stillform/media/courtyard-original.jpg" download aria-label="Download the quiet courtyard, full resolution JPEG, 1,103 KB">Full resolution JPEG · 1,103 KB</a>
      </figure>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Landscape</p>
        <h2>The quiet courtyard</h2>
        <p>Read the path by its edges and leave the planting in shadow.</p>
        <dl>
          <dt>Walk at eye level</dt>
          <dd>Check the sequence from each doorway and from the approach. Keep the light sources out of the normal line of sight.</dd>
          <dt>Repeat when wet</dt>
          <dd>A damp paving sample reflects light differently. Check it after rain or wet the test area before choosing a finish.</dd>
          <dt>Plan maintenance</dt>
          <dd>Show where every fitting can be reached and aim it with planting at its expected height. Record adjustments at handover.</dd>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <footer class="wrap footer">
    <strong>Stillform Studio</strong>
