<header class="intro"><p class="tag">Listening library</p><h1>Restoration cases</h1><p class="lede">Choose a tape format or listen for a specific defect. Each example has a time-aligned comparison and its own restoration notes.</p></header><div class="filter-panel"><label>Search cases<input id="catalog-search" type="search"></label><label>Category<select id="catalog-category"><option value="">All</option><option value="cassette">Cassette</option><option value="reel">Open reel</option><option value="micro">Microcassette</option></select></label><p id="catalog-count" role="status"></p></div><p id="catalog-empty" hidden>No results. Clear the search or change the category.</p><div class="tiles"><article class="catalog-card" data-category="cassette"><p class="tag">Cassette</p><h2><a href="/cases/hiss.html">Cassette listening copy</a></h2><p>Broadband hiss and hum</p></article>
