<article class="catalog-card" data-category="micro"><p class="tag">Microcassette</p><h2><a href="/cases/pocket.html">Pocket recorder cleanup</a></h2><p>Impulses and noise</p></article>
<article class="catalog-card" data-category="cassette"><p class="tag">Cassette</p><h2><a href="/cases/practice.html">A damaged rehearsal tape</a></h2><p>Level dropouts</p></article></div>
