<header class="wrap mast"><a class="brand" href="/"><span aria-hidden="true">◉</span>Signal Archive</a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/index.html">Home</a><a href="/studio.html">Listen & estimate</a><a href="/formats.html">Formats</a><a href="/cases.html">Case library</a><a href="/delivery.html">Delivery</a></nav></header>
<main class="wrap" id="main">
<header class="intro"><p class="tag">Open reel</p><h1>An uneven reel transfer</h1><p class="lede">Cyclic pitch drift · 18 second listening sample</p></header><section class="labgrid"><article class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><p class="tag">Listening room</p><h2>Before and after</h2></div><p>Listen to the pitch movement on the first few repeating notes. The corrected version stays steady at the same timing.</p><div class="toggle" role="group" aria-label="Recording version"><button type="button" data-audio="before" aria-pressed="true">Before · transfer</button><button type="button" data-audio="after" aria-pressed="false">After · restored</button></div><audio id="sample" controls preload="none" data-base="/assets/archive/samples/reel-" src="/assets/archive/samples/reel-before.mp3" aria-label="Audio restoration comparison"></audio><p class="micro" id="player-status" role="status">Selected: before, raw transfer.</p><p class="micro">Synthetic demonstration · 18 seconds</p></article><article class="panel"><h2>Restoration notes</h2><dl class="steps"><dt>Assess</dt><dd>Check speed and tension during the first playback. Separate cyclic movement from an incorrect nominal speed.</dd><dt>Treat</dt><dd>Use the stable passages to reference the pitch and keep duration aligned for the listening comparison.</dd><dt>Deliver</dt><dd>Note the nominal speed, original channel setup and the segments where the correction was used.</dd></dl></article></section><section class="section"><h2>Estimate a similar transfer</h2><p class="spaced">The estimate starts with one 22 minute item and restoration. Adjust those values for your recording.</p><p class="spaced"><a class="button" href="/estimate.html?format=reel&minutes=22&restore=1#estimate">Use this example in the estimate</a></p><p class="spaced"><a href="/cases.html">Browse other cases</a> · <a href="/delivery.html">See delivery formats</a></p></section>
</main>
<footer class="wrap footer"><strong>Signal Archive</strong><a href="/formats.html">Formats</a></footer>
</body>
</html>
