<main class="wrap" id="main">
<header class="intro"><p class="tag">Transfer guide</p><h1>From intake to delivery</h1><p class="lede">Choose a preservation master, a listening copy or both. Keep a log with enough detail to understand the files later.</p></header><div class="tiles guide"><article><h2>Preservation master</h2><p>A lossless WAV transfer with the track order, source format and any observed damage documented.</p></article><article><h2>Listening copy</h2><p>A separate export with the requested noise and level treatment. Use MP3 for convenient playback or WAV for further editing.</p></article><article><h2>Transfer notes</h2><p>Keep the original filenames, source side, speed and any repairs together with the delivered files.</p></article></div><p class="spaced"><a class="button" href="/prepare.html">Prepare your recordings</a></p>
<p class="spaced"><a href="/planning.html">Calculate storage for your preservation copies</a> · <a href="/archive-help.html">Read common questions</a></p></main>
<footer class="wrap footer"><strong>Signal Archive</strong><a href="/formats.html">Formats</a></footer>
</body>
</html>
