<main class="wrap" id="main">
<header class="intro"><p class="tag">Transfer services</p><h1>Formats and rates</h1><p class="lede">The item fee covers inspection and setup. Recorded minutes are billed separately. Restoration is optional.</p></header><div class="panel"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Format</th><th scope="col">Per item</th><th scope="col">Per minute</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Compact cassette</th><td>€6</td><td>€0.35</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Open reel ¼″</th><td>€12</td><td>€0.55</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Microcassette</th><td>€8</td><td>€0.45</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Optional restoration adds €0.30 per recorded minute. Example pricing in EUR.</p></div><section class="section"><h2>Preparing your recording</h2><div class="tiles"><article><h3>Label the sides</h3><p>Indicate preferred sides and any sections to skip.</p></article><article><h3>Keep reels in their boxes</h3><p>Write the track format and speed when known.</p></article><article><h3>Flag damage</h3><p>Note sticking, mould or a brittle cassette shell before shipping.</p></article></div></section>
<p class="spaced"><a class="button" href="/delivery.html">Read the delivery guide</a></p><section class="section"><h2>Format guides</h2><div class="tiles"><article><h3><a href="/formats/cassette.html">Compact cassette</a></h3><p>Shell, sides and levels</p></article><article><h3><a href="/formats/open-reel.html">Open reel ¼″</a></h3><p>Speed and track layout</p></article><article><h3><a href="/formats/microcassette.html">Microcassette</a></h3><p>Recorder speed and quiet passages</p></article></div></section></main>
