cat > "${WEBROOT}/listening-guide.html" <<'EOF_LISTENING_GUIDE_HTML'
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="description" content="Compare a transfer with its restoration and estimate a cassette or reel project.">
<link rel="icon" href="/assets/archive/favicon.png" type="image/png">
<title>Listening guide · Signal Archive</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/archive/site.css?v=e11c3659ae">
</head>
<body class="archive">
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<header class="wrap mast"><a class="brand" href="/"><span aria-hidden="true">◉</span>Signal Archive</a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/index.html">Home</a><a href="/studio.html">Listen & estimate</a><a href="/formats.html">Formats</a><a href="/cases.html">Case library</a><a href="/delivery.html">Delivery</a></nav></header>
<main class="wrap" id="main">
<header class="intro"><p class="tag">Listening library</p><h1>How to compare a transfer</h1><p class="lede">Use the same playback level and listen to the same short passage in both versions.</p></header>
<section class="panel"><h2>What to listen for</h2><dl class="steps">
<dt>Steady noise</dt><dd>Play a quiet gap between notes and listen for a constant background level.</dd>
<dt>Pitch drift</dt><dd>Use sustained or repeated notes to hear small changes in pitch without moving the playback position.</dd>
<dt>Short defects</dt><dd>Clicks have a sharp onset. Dropouts sound like a brief loss in level. Mark an approximate time before switching versions.</dd>
<dt>Source and limits</dt><dd>The examples use synthetic audio. The before tracks add a specific defect to each source sequence, and the after tracks use the aligned clean signal. Real transfers need a case-by-case assessment.</dd>
</dl><p class="spaced"><a href="/sample-files.html">Download the comparison pairs</a> · <a href="/cases.html">Open the playable cases</a></p></section>
</main>
<footer class="wrap footer"><strong>Signal Archive</strong><a href="/formats.html">Formats</a></footer>
</body>
</html>
EOF_LISTENING_GUIDE_HTML
